Package: xtxapi
Title: Cross-Modal Generative Interfaces
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Troy", "Hernandez", email = "troy@cornball.ai", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description:
    xtxapi provides a unified interface for cross-modal generative models,
    enabling transformations between text, image, audio, and video modalities.
    The package acts as a lightweight orchestration layer over external
    generation engines such as diffusion models, talking-head systems,
    and hosted APIs. It is designed to integrate cleanly with the sttapi
    and ttsapi packages.
